    {
      "title": null,
      "text": "%md\n## CTRP extracts (Customs Taxpayer Risk Profiling Model)\nRun the paragraphs **in order**, one at a time. Each one says what it does and how long to expect.\n\n1. **Settings**: finds your home folder on the cluster by itself. Nothing needs changing.\n2. **Data range**: how far back the view goes (fast checks, no full counts).\n3. **Definitions**: loads the SQL and helper functions. Takes seconds.\n4. **Test run**: one snapshot (31 Mar 2026), to time it before running everything.\n5. **Run all**: the remaining snapshots, each with the main extract and the Track B features.\n6. **Check outputs**: rows, one row per taxpayer, Track B present, and a summary table.\n\nNothing is written to any folder unless you set `SAVE_TO_FOLDER = True` in paragraph 1.\n\nGenerated by `python main.py zeppelin` from the project, so the SQL is identical to `sql/<name>.sql`.\nAPC 483 is kept for now (DECISIONS 65).",
      "user": "anonymous",
      "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13 00:00:00.000",
      "progress": 0,
      "config": {
        "editorSetting": {
          "language": "markdown",
