    {
      "title": null,
      "text": "%pyspark\n# ---------- 5. Run all the other snapshots: the ONE LONG RUN (one after another) -----------\n# Every back-test date from Sep 2017 to Mar 2026 plus the live date. Safe to re-run after a\n# failure or a dropped session: finished snapshots are skipped, so it carries on where it stopped.\nfor snap, live in SNAPSHOTS:\n    if (snap, live) == TEST_SNAPSHOT:\n        continue                      # already done in paragraph 4\n    run_snapshot(snap, live)\nprint('all done')",
